# Wiki as source of truth

Canonical docs live in `wiki/` (this repo's GitHub Wiki source). **Read the matching page with the Read tool** before implementing, explaining, or changing that system. Do not invent APIs from memory. If wiki and code disagree, trust the code and mention the drift.

Read only the pages you need. Do not paste wiki pages wholesale into replies.

## What to read

| Task | Wiki page |
|------|-----------|
| Events, scene labels, pools, priorities, fragments | `wiki/Events.md` |
| Conditions / gating (`AND`/`OR`/`NOT`, catalog) | `wiki/Conditions.md` |
| Selectors / dynamic kwargs | `wiki/Selectors.md` |
| Effects (apply/revert) | `wiki/Effects.md` |
| Modifiers / stat drift | `wiki/Modifiers.md` |
| Options / trailing flags | `wiki/Options.md` |
| Situations (bars, hints, resolutions) | `wiki/Building-Situations.md` |
| Unlockables (rules, clubs, buildings, PTA) | `wiki/Building-Unlockables.md` |
| School levels / campus climate, dress, talk, event tone | `wiki/School-Levels.md` |
| Image paths, `Pattern`, WebP, `$` fallbacks | `wiki/Images.md` |
| Paperdoll / layered sprites | `wiki/Paperdoll.md` |
| Journal map highlight / unseen journal news | `wiki/Journal-Alerts.md` |
| Mods (register, layout, enable) | `wiki/Modding.md` |
| System overview / how pieces fit | `wiki/Developer-Guide.md` |
| Cast, bios, outfits | `wiki/Characters.md` then `wiki/characters/<Name>/<Name>.md` |
| Walkthroughs / player-facing | `wiki/Player-Guide.md`, `wiki/Player-Walkthroughs.md`, `wiki/Walkthrough-*.md` |
| Cheat menu | `wiki/Cheat-Menu.md` |

Index: `wiki/_Sidebar.md`. Page map and sync workflow: `wiki/README.md`.

## Situations / Unlockables

To **design or implement** one, follow the `build-situation` skill. Still read the two Building-* wiki pages first.

## Editing the wiki

Edit files in `wiki/`, not on GitHub. See `wiki/README.md`. Pages have no `# H1` (title comes from the filename). Cross-page links use `[Label](Page-Name)`.
